{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "": {},
    "%@ asks for a check": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ が確認を求めています"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ client ID": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ のクライアント ID"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ · %lld chapters": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ · %2$lld 話"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld": {},
    "%lld book%@ moved.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$lld 冊を移しました。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld chapters": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 話"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld chapters are not on the device, so the search does not read them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 話は端末にないため、検索の対象になりません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld chapters on the device": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "端末にある話: %lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld installed": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 件インストール済み"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld new chapters": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "新しい話 %lld 件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld of %lld": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$lld / %2$lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld pages": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld ページ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld title%@ for \"%@\"": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%3$@」の作品 %1$lld 件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 chapter": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1 話"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 new chapter": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "新しい話 1 件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A book uses this mode until you choose a mode for it in the reader. A comic with \"YesAndRightToLeft\" in its ComicInfo.xml opens from the right to the left. With \"Keep the screen on\", the screen does not go dark while a book is open. With \"Private reading\", the books that you read do not go into the history or into Continue reading.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "リーダーで本ごとのモードを選ぶまで、本はこのモードを使います。ComicInfo.xml に「YesAndRightToLeft」がある漫画は右から左に開きます。「画面をオンのままにする」では、本を開いている間、画面が暗くなりません。「プライベート読書」では、読んだ本が履歴にも「続きを読む」にも入りません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A list marks some sources for adults. Asabunko does not install them and hides them until you turn this on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "リストには成人向けのソースがあります。これをオンにするまで、Asabunko はそれらをインストールせず、表示もしません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A quiet night for reading": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "静かな読書の夜"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "このアプリについて"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "追加"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add a bookmark here": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ここにしおりを追加"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add a category": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "カテゴリを追加"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add a source list in Settings, Sources. Asabunko installs its sources, and their popular titles show here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "設定の「ソース」でソースリストを追加してください。Asabunko がそのソースをインストールし、人気の作品がここに表示されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add sources": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ソースを追加"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add to the read list": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "読書リストに追加"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appearance": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "外観"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apply": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "適用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Asabunko": {},
    "Asabunko cannot do this action.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Asabunko はこの操作を実行できません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Asabunko cannot read the files of this book.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Asabunko はこの本のファイルを読めません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Asabunko does not save while the library file cannot be read, so the file stays as it is. Restore a backup below, or start a new, empty library. A copy of the old file stays next to it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ライブラリのファイルを読めない間、Asabunko は保存しないため、ファイルはそのまま残ります。下でバックアップを復元するか、新しい空のライブラリを始めてください。古いファイルのコピーは隣に残ります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Asabunko keeps your books on this device. It has no account and no analytics. The app asks GitHub for the newest version.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Asabunko は本をこの端末に保存します。アカウントも分析もありません。アプリは最新バージョンを GitHub に問い合わせます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ascending": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "昇順"
          }
        }
      }
